<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia forex reserves ease to $4.18 bln in Sept.</title>
<headline>Slovenia forex reserves ease to $4.18 bln in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of SLovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Friday.</p>
<p>FOREIGN EXCHANGE RESERVES</p>
<p>    (in millions of dollars)    Sep	 Aug	  Sep 95</p>
<p>    Total reserves		  4,179.2   4,209.6*   3,357.9</p>
<p>    Bank of Slovenia reserves   2,265.9   2,283.8    1,710.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Total reserves are those held by the banking sector as a whole.</p>
<p>* - new estimate</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana Newsroom, 386-61-126-3644</p>
